	(text "100 mA per lamp is a DESIGN ALLOCATION, not a measured lamp current. 32 lamps = 3.2 A.\nXH cable mating parts: XHP-4 + 4 x SXH-001T-P0.6 per button. Accepts 22-28 AWG; strain-relieve.\nAdafruit 1194: 3835 pigtails fit switch tabs; 3838 fit lamp tabs. See BOM for pack quantities.\nReplace pigtail 2-pin ends with genuine XH contacts / 4-pin housing. Menu-button tab sizes UNVERIFIED."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 273 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.05 1.05)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "5eb6dfdb-31df-453b-8732-c2be4741d45e")
	)
	(text "Jx: 1=+12V lamp, 2=switched lamp cathode, 3=switch NO, 4=switch COM/GND.\nAdafruit 1194 includes an LED resistor for operation up to 12 V. No extra series resistor fitted.\nEG STARTS menu lamps specified as 12 V; current / tab dimensions need confirmation.\nUse normally-open contacts; leave any NC switch terminal insulated and unused."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 29 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.15 1.15)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "6e32297e-13f3-4e24-bd99-136c9a31bd93")
	)
	(text "BUTTON HARNESS | bank 4 | four wires per illuminated button"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 16 0)
		(effects
